{"v":4,"catch":"難度高，但非常上癮的足球遊戲！","desc":"World Soccer Kid的規則非常簡單。\n只需移動Soccer Kid，用頭頂球即可。\n但頂球時，若球遠離頭部中心，球會彈出更遠處，因此想要連續成功多次，並不容易。\n適用此類簡單規則的模式共有4種。\n記錄拋球次數的基本模式；拋球時記錄向前奔跑距離的賽跑模式；與對手比賽拋球持續時間的雙人對戰模式；以及與對方協作拋球，並記錄次數的雙人協作模式。\n請加油練習，成為世界第一的Soccer Kid！","publisher":"Game Museum","release":"2022-03-24","genres":["運動","街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","法文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5bbaff68dbe12d10ef4da1bb9e6e099c7649f6a174c2038bc08bba65075f1db4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/10eb5262b4cacd12e705d45d4a36d44e3744901e4f4bded60dc46bfc594216f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/edda1c35adbff125fc37769571cd91bf9f3cd2fd9751ef6adeb3213d39251a48.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff81af12c3b4f8198df8ac4294401c4b53c5b68e6e3065ee7f41eae42a67dff0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f779b260a037c7f1c83a2b41ed9f310466661cad41fb217e65b14997a7075951.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e53e74df09bfe4d49d2ba38d2cbc7b25431f5fd4054653d15084b9765a1fcdc1.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d76017b42000","dlc":[]}